    <Element Type="Comment" Id="4DCBE83C">
        <Comment>
            These come in 3 flavors
            - Burning Residue leaves a patch of fire in a targeted location, dealing minimal initial damage and moderate damage over time to units standing in the area
            - Solar Storms deal no damage but drain the shields and energy of units within as well as slowing mechanical units down
            - Mass Ejections have a long warning before landing, but will instantly kill any units remaining in the area and leave behind a permanent pool of fire.
            Residue and Storms spawn on a timer, Mass Ejections occur in preplaced locations over time
        </Comment>
